        "TileImage": "$($repository b42ecffe-aca9-4c3d-964f-052c957c588d).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Our client has requested that we kill three employees of the notorious Ark Society. Specifically two of the main helicopter mechanics and one of their personal guards.\r\rThese three targets are extremely high profile and well regarded within the society. Therefore, we expect this to cause trouble among the members. Killing these targets will render the helicopter useless to the Society and will foil their future plans until they replace it.\r\rGood luck.\r\rHappy hunting, 47.",
